# W31d, host a (k10): hosts Dry Land; once b, c and d joined and b fell (the test hook, @470) a goes into dng204b1 alone
# (matz01) and waits there for the others (c's GO takes b and d along).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log a hosts Dry Land
idle until present=4,sealed>=300 or epoch>=@460 fail stagechange
log b, c and d joined
idle until epoch>=@480 fail stagechange
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng204b1,control fail epoch>=@820
log a in dng204b1
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=600
idle until present=4,sealed>=300 fail epoch>=@1200
log b, c and d joined a in B1
idle until frames>=300
